{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1500,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f0b8360fd5d38fba4c66e3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要和救主同学一起，挑战戴墨镜！\r\n目标是改变形象，\r\n然后进行长长的晒太阳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed9ee9f476ed19188623d62e5c11fe2e2a9c41730a93781de3c630eef778bbf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26b59fc80775b65de56aa2a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要找到东商前辈拜托我的\r\n传说中的扫帚！首先是各教室，\r\n探索开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "862cb026c05e9be8e7a3266f09eefa8e157d125a778d865730cb7bb15cc8f91c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59f7d2401ebb78f0f20c0c4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！我肩膀上有虫子！！\r\n虫子~！！……诶？线头？？\r\n啊、啊哈哈，给你添麻烦了~",
      "source_fingerprint": "b265c509ddd9f09d9ae94bd3cbd8a3fd84626993f0d8f960c4b4c7b74b8ab767",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2eb5aa8c06e2bcfb0c77b35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把后冠路线的报道\r\n贴在笔记本上了。\r\n总有一天，我的比赛也要……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ce92570a5896af20eab217eb393d091a8ec481d1d33672257ee1179b9a11eba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82672dbb6dd536343f21ed5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸他明明工作很累了\r\n还坚持要来看我的下一场比赛。\r\n真是的~也太顽固了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e52bf295665ae91db2a778d3e74af20f13555caef781d1aeb5133bcfd21e601b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:422b9c8cc6f1c55ddf99e185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的舞蹈，是怎样的呢……\r\n不，我要做的事只有一件，\r\n那就是练习到能完成为止！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7dfd9e68c7412e3d6c63fbc1907d1d6ad9ede138aae6012cb5b929a1914496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2c84aa553a4a297ac6513f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不只是比赛，还有我的名字……\r\n我的心意，都想被某人铭记。\r\n我想完成这样的Live！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d2d19478d0a384f6c5b92d499303877c68165501614e84132795795e4c33912",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07c8c74ee095cbdc7867f618",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红色的蝴蝶结，看起有点花哨呢？\r\n不过，我会展现出和它的华丽\r\n完美符合的活跃身姿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79869cf2692c5edc406b5b942e3ece99eeddecbc3715226a36061580da825fff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a43489cbda87ec33f96dcd65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到我背后星星的孩子，\r\n会变得想要憧憬，想要追逐……\r\n我要展示出这样的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "479f3236f7830b5997bf3c268f2a779aaeb95cee1beee53e0d57107d1436a324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61c4c187af12f36dc905afd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早饭打的生鸡蛋出现了两个蛋黄♪\r\n这也许是好事发生的前兆……\r\n欸嘿嘿，好期待~",
      "source_fingerprint": "3476d4cd24ea3f10059166cd852c3de0e9e05d7858fb654fedd1293ec395e511",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a3e7856be5a1bcf3a55779",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点，快点去训练吧！\r\n不然的话，晒太阳的诱惑就要~",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfca67349b8fc06ca56a577869344f6d0cc80244c5ba513c9c5bc035b9dae882",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:682c78d51aa9a32e49ef95bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会打败你，\n开创属于我的未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07851d26350ef8860577b3e56e79f1ec49700a9e1a3f77b27e63d3dc0b7930a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7c37bafd5bc4196847fbfad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，虽然已经很晚了，\r\n但还是希望能帮我检查一下体态……\r\n我想改良到满意为止！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb1b98d753535b5e0c1427fb1c65f5d0f519de2536c31a3d156a45d69a862e35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:655ec748de60add65a2658d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有樱花所以我很喜欢春天！\r\n它们华丽又惹人怜爱……\r\n今年也要多多拍照喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46e450f9252ee1b3130f9b2d9b2abef056b35e96fd0097b19709722f5fc362f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65e6d094916b8bb6351308c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在夏日的阳光下沐浴10分钟，\r\n然后乘凉10分钟。这是我想出来的\r\n『晒太阳活』，要一起体验一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2387ee9004d2a789615540089422a1f74b091f6fd6dc30e2ef5e30bcca35147d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10cf2a7be2d2684ce97209b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就想到橡~子♪说到橡子\r\n就想到帽~子♪说到帽子就想到\r\n脑袋♪说到脑袋，就想到后冠~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ec93929efe0acef90f2cd2f088b187d326ef0add7100ba2ef0faa811ce64bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39110f268661cedaa6ad9be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使积雪很多，也请放心。\r\n就让我来开拓道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfa52b9b539c10679cde55a91824fcc7caf9059fa859cca5799d50f69c9fc84f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af4f97fa63c6872c2f05d6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太宠着的话对潘多拉同学不好……\n好！今后给她分的零食就减半吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8660b16481a2dea323d2a31c8f98741e9f4725c2cdb9f6a7c86db562a822f2c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb8c8903ae011fa193577ca5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥做的饭全都很好吃……！\n她做的料理我每次都会拍照纪念~",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7008ee072856e644f797a50c82497448aa34a1945d9a2dc3f12d8c70ee4b8f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a75fbd41c83b732174e70bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前晒太阳晒得迷迷糊糊的时候，\n圣王前辈也过来了……\n默默地帮我盖上了毯子！欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8cc647a4c2305527c34c5725f01455115c0d250189038a15577614ccc8ce8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36077b6377869e7c5d7e08b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了和心心同学聊天，我现在\n对自己的英语很有自信哦！那个~\nI very like tiara！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcaad2d35eb90c16902703b9484f791b04a56d5315d26c977c762fbdb45f7e46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d07537161b7e568728598de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "教了一下救主同学怎么裁缝，\n没想到她马上就能缝得很细致……！\n下次打算一起试试十字绣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac4d3ae859cd665b67931eb7ecc3c7790a79ab90fcd450d995765437b8a0f99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfabca8aec985fd5c77e7155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨跑碰见日出时，\n我都会大声向太阳说早上好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3213114d9f78b3101068c719c121e4d9cc01f6a7fc28e436a876af9702b6ebce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb04deaebb7a6e549c61b91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我买了晒太阳用的便携枕头！\n用起来真的很舒服呢。……不过，\n最舒服的还是西沙里奥的膝枕♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cbe3fc2650934adeb879d7f425c3cb9bc9e5a6f6ccc6e2928de0393dffb8e90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c65f446aabe875cc7a351e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑暗乃魔族之域，夜晚乃\n魔族之时……哼、哼、哼……哼哼。\n这是我正在读的小说台词。",
      "source_fingerprint": "790ff6fd1f1883303319346a7261970a3b695182e766d7935359efefb5570d28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:162a7331047c29af635ddcf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一看到樱花飘零散落，我就会想着\n它盛开时的模样而忍不住去捡起来。\n……欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a705eac796c609ddee231400c011ac28973cfc79e06dce4479221a26380d3197",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc497fe8044fa230174279e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在户外泳池晒太阳也很棒的哦~\n坐上大大的泳圈，\n吧嗒吧嗒地漂在上面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84b65f13ab94090f83305b5c44fcd8939b3ecf80631de8f1b03c4d48ed70e1cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:726eb03d5de939649837b48b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为到了艺术之秋，\n我给后辈们开了手工课。\n请称呼我为莱茵老师！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14818b640cfb70f3d6eca09715cb35df9c857f006303c5d66b54ecc2d2343fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e87e1abf096b60ba0e3bf4df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "窝在被炉里织东西会很顺手呢~\n就是每年都会织得太多\n最后只能分给大家……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15065ee3be7367696869fc71ddc33bebd7dc7df32d03e0acf0ce8b689d55c639",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd401eaef37d918dee636f4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然自己这么说有点羞耻，\n感觉自己像公主一样……简直就是\n小说里才会出现的人物，好开心啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "26cb9f47e62ef96e21eda9d8249d2dc5f32585dfcdd5e54986b0b54415329cad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d81213f81b2eb798a723cb77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我穿着有点浪费，\n但还是要这种漂亮的衣服\n才能更好地让大家记住吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76f980c0fade98876f4bc2dd7386ea4eb743b6f6ad0c421f4c056b292b5834dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97546ce780a5e0c5c3357f9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想变得更强。\r\n为了能用自己的双腿开拓未来……\r\n训练就拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46245853c886dd760e0c9790247132cfc1ec4fbcab186db67a519f8f1e595cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fd573ac8dd34e62342851af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aa1fdd4bc6113ec52b7a67e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣呣呣~！\r\n东商前辈亲授，训练魔法~！\r\n……好，已经完全做好准备了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccb09432f76925d0e86a771e9d3bb6c35ac1853e0d87b8766212bf55634c7952",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a0a6ac148ba7990f03b51ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！\r\n我已经复习过\r\n所有后冠赛马娘的影像了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eccff6f4fa6c4cc70892d04a176c77929d9193d404f5efa114be64017886178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c294855b22687b35d858dae3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真好啊~\r\n太阳公公好像也在支持着我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd92782ed90833413cc2f72a45bdfc9dd6c0fdd124afdcfeed738099cb2ba664",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49dac31885222e174d5546c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请告诉我。要想变得更强……\r\n要想开拓未来的话，必须该做什么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59147e515310cdcb287952706c360b32699216cfb2a2b99f022c63f0ed749c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc50c07831fef029ccd20fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请相信我，我能做到最后，\r\n这也会成为我的一份助力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f64cb5653b77d7dc8865091a065c0e587a446afbbb33d1ce667babd0f02d72e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa6e666225e35b3bd0427310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你一直为我照亮前进的道路。\r\n多亏了你，我才能够直直地往前跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb955bcdc4f2348f4258b8b16ed890cef0f319c1bd5da251d3555ab1a3fe5cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:715dff094290493900622884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "持续沐浴夏日的阳光，\r\n应该就能不怕热了！\r\n好了，GO——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af5f38e394b93c7a8e5a262b488b692aae0f196e562a00cff0ecf6a36e9ed1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c767638363c4494fcc4725",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了今后能够传承未来……\n训练就拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bcef58f196312caa8744dda7bc2af9cf8b29f3b7aa3760cb4ca9717889bbc35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7684f7bc8aa528b7f7ac8e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让他人从自己的奔跑中看到梦想，\n我想以此为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "590b4f815df0d842d309508f8230f925f849049ef937da342c32282fc7fd0236",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eea1fb416da125159c2fe5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也很风和日丽呢~……\n啊，不行！要随时保持状态！\n好~嘞……要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01864111990cce002d1660ebfbdc033d3509968dc288fd2dac5101352e68673d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:221f35163afb55fd2f54202c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳下头冠正闪闪发亮！\n我也要跑得闪闪发亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3403754b36e3df624e41ef01924a76c7c5dd087319962a9d5ca8258c98c993d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dfc327b548b36c2885bb891",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想开辟一条\n只有自己才能够传承的道路……\n为此，我要变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff3cd8907cb1c3b6c13d5382dea46869f459ec6dda3dbaae0558ff4e5b7bffb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f19c07a89e25295775f017dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未来必将由我的双脚开辟。\n所以……我跑过的每一步，\n希望都能一直留存在你心里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b340fe845bee800a8db31345c9ad04a70442e8f0fa8f38f18cfb5b6bd6087d42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ead4088110d74deb45d8090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我奔跑的轨迹，我奔跑过的证明……\n希望它能一直，一~直延续到未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af65128799483ba09f07dc0a6705bd45dedecf549330c673e79504bc123d7fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab7952c0f5dcf0215a008206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条道路前方所连结的东西，\r\n我想和你一起守护。",
      "source_fingerprint": "761617b5f5654e90b5875ab721d3460b51d427b5b13b4c6be811682b40ddf763",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f48c0740ca6e12284ccc13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲线~~！\r\n我奔跑过的证明，\r\n留存下来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1168f06420bed0013f10ce83be3666623cb80c2755f0db255cdd7881b76af85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5181f44185566db92a5f608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起\n去不断开辟前方的道路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32a10f891cdf4376b5456bcb47664d7063cb35bafef8486466de25a531242391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d9f0cb9810d29d863cd7b14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的轨迹。\n不知道有没有给谁\n……带来梦想呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "727434d14f29e62b253ed248dcf06caf288bbe17be66f3de9cb3464ba7a35eb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb49cf3044d4035d51e0b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离后冠更进一步了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc56919901a9687cfca128dc6816f1b314669bcd184d3fddebb8c829a0b8e7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22049f194b0e420445fa2ecd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这份力量，去开辟道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49dc8d6588419f55452c604af0db6f45c1fb9a8560a0a0b68db35ed017d29f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c994884b20ad89b4b61fa323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量。目标是，后冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c67d8e82b98c364c88175a0c4d46cb7f5f7311673d6c7d9a1b0daedaf3d9cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e00908811d786c65cb72860c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了将心意与某人联系在一起。\r\n我会不断进行挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1266d48eb9b3261ae9ecf4cae88c7a5a0560075fa8967ca5bc0c8412a4d87616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e679eadb67b4c991176e5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来领头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "024ac4b84219f36d44cdba21f13b28265cb4e2b35a2a24fdf7f5ca76c1d38709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f314c28bc63b4a980ebd158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了与未来相连！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3aaeadbe12b066c781634e88669b6016d92c2d87ab17c8926bb078bd022f4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d7b0705b96eed64bea70c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开拓未来的接力棒，就由我来传递！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f101ebb473dabc4c619468dea757485cac0d63ad82deb26ea93d82eb3e3ebebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c017bb09b52723779f7b566",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把令人眩目的速度，展现给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0fe841ca136e3dd5dccc833bf6f78f09a6c07c1a57a4f3e2b696a862b41c510",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f2e291bdff7a85b26af0f0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯有这双脚，\n才能描绘出独特轨迹。\n我会以此将未来相连！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a655987ac103d2f0cf709be43295ef2725ffe61f89ee7798501658d43f84b1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a37b58964b418ee853648f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是莱茵力量！\n我想去开拓通向未来的轨迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc8eeccc91c4162c9aea64eac53bac8e799e4be01bb3f1c4d8dca161f64babf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4708b08b6ea730620d1d15f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们跑出一场精彩的比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81236871ec5f4a269543a225f435521d7823920423af39a037a7f589e49e85bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef85732544d98c31d3f35714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您所赌上的『生涯』，\n我绝不会，让它白费。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8081935176f8b01736fb7bedbab2cd9011dc08899d49d644adbc00b57cd4edf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ffb243f46509be60d8322c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ee371240fedf3b9c86b4f16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a841b1e61175b4785fcdf9f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闭上双眼想象的未来里，\n一定有您的身影……没有比这\n更令人心安的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e497578898b55dd74cdee316b2fa8ab485ae5d3ed29abaf5805029b4a5d31f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34e853c36eb7cc14b74f2420",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我新找到了\n双人喜剧的剧本哦！\n待会儿一起练习吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e30683c25c757296f1878a2770ea51cdab513184f9d11f2622d16e496c8dd176",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55ac611fa270b1fd71878e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您已经吃过御节料理了吗？\n至少今天就暂停工作和家务，\n好好养精蓄锐，为新的一年储备活力吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5882a8e1861081bf2fe27f1889c5531af41425fe7d33ad09346fcc5f8ddf3a26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ca972ae46e789cee8da5b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我试着用蛋糕表现了\n直至今日与您共度的时光。\n……味道如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc4dc0c768105c56352d24ecdd882d93ecce38b4e8b21501eef4e0f777b9f327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1089d10b0a63b630603f2915",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节晚餐，\n一起制作再一起享用……呵呵！\n明年也，再一起做吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c1491770eb94053fe3d0816fcbcd175dc2d44eacef21a965e4bd94badb39e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1eb5641cba20379041719ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯愿……如夜空闪烁的繁星，\n纵使刹那往复，\n也能与大家长久共存。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb4adbd84a60e84a32834b2bf36c654cb1a39d235ae44388d02a63b5c7e0f31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5e4bb62ac529474ee2c3424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Trick or Treat!\n训练员，您要是只顾着工作\n我就要恶作剧了哦？呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d94b010e10903911a93e0d3b51a78dd3753338c2b6adf9ae8f81d84c0b89833b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c699a16391cd0513090ae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我还想过要醒着\n抓住圣诞老人呢。心想才不会被\n礼物骗到！我要守护这个家～之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66e2c6867fca1420155c93a3666c1403d8ecb8857e04b8f9b12b5e9a1000b0b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da24e45dbef768ff1bf0bfa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节想要的礼物……？嗯～……\n呵呵……在缔结契约的时候，\n我也许已经全部都拿到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "283b21c32e939a47b4c40ace6b3feb825eaaacf62519d7efd631addc7f5415f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09641e93392b5b4426e7173f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f9cddfc1cbf662050361639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过完年，可以给您打电话吗？\n新的一年也要受您照顾，\n我想尽早给您拜个年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca639b782e43b802949c891c0398f217e700e039b9d4d5cfc78b8a8628782e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b211e04fd307084dba722d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您出生，成长……\n到与我相遇，如今共同希冀着未来。\n……我要对这份奇迹，献上由衷的感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b80a3d84d189d4e330c292fc83b281f1107394c58441eba1616bd5febaaaeb71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb75a8e2c408ff9cdff6cde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明只有两个人的派对，\n饭菜却做得太多了……那个……\n就让我们过一个饱腹的生日吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77577869254aa6daf6f202dfff3a516f7fb1c082628c9d51e1076b2c2d340b9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a10f9eacb67508d0f0940ccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和特别周小姐认真的并排跑……\n虽说只是生日礼物，\n但我真的是受宠若惊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2f8c50b901804978ce08a203f55b2d9473eaa303d70d75ccc3e2953bae22bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60c09adf2914311b087c05d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明年也要和您一起\n谈论未来，编织未来，迈向未来。\n……礼物的话，这个就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f6737e1e034216dcb13592e675e693dd3be17d6423d375cc296319fe09bd25c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10014"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
